This this year, Trump, who threatened last year to "totally destroy North Korea," sang at U.N. Practitioner Practitioner to Kim for his courage in doing disguise, but said there was still a lot of work to be done ahead of him, and the sanctions must remain until North Korea is deprived of nuclear weapons.
